  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 5646,
  "text_len": 8
 },
 {
  "id": "sce235:0161A",
  "jp": "ヤマト「‥‥二人ともすごいけど、ニャぐりあいがそんニャに{nl}　楽しいのかニャ‥‥？」",
  "off": 5658,
  "len": 52,
  "en": "Yamato: ...You're both amazing, but is trading punches really that nyuch fun? I wonder, nya...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 5660,
  "text_len": 49
 },
 {
  "id": "sce235:01651",
  "jp": "メリッサ「そうよねぇ～　でもこんなに楽しそうな{nl}　シィウチェンって見たことない。{nl}　ちょっと悔しいな」",
  "off": 5713,
  "len": 58,
